[2.401591, "o", "PASS 240000 seeded mixed operations; bounded cache; zero mappings after trim\r\nAll independent allocator tests passed.\r\n"]
[5.405559, "o", "\r\nDesign: 8 shards, 64 small size classes, reusable private anonymous mappings.\r\nLarge reuse: >64 KiB through 1 MiB; all empty caches share a 2 MiB cap.\r\nCross-thread frees use immutable region ownership; trim touches no live object.\r\n"]
[8.408779, "o", "\r\nRecorded five-process comparison (shared laptop; not official scores):\r\n"]
[8.423285, "o", "Large throughput, 8 threads (calls/s): 43663.450 -> 74036.324\r\nLarge malloc p99, 8 threads (us): 1784.819 -> 1105.217\r\nMixed throughput, 8 threads (M calls/s): 57.639 -> 51.240\r\n"]
[8.426307, "o", "Cost: large burst VM rose 34.7%; mixed throughput median fell 11.1%.\r\nLimits: sparse survivors still pin regions; cache misses still have long tails.\r\n"]
[12.429343, "o", "\r\nReview: docs/architecture.md, docs/report.md and raw results.\r\nAI assistance disclosed in docs/author.md; permission is user-reported SPOC approval.\r\nSee docs/review-guide.md for the rubric and reproducible evaluation.\r\n"]
